    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boring tool</i> used in making wells, <i><span class="en">
				Philyll.
				18
			</span></i> as cited by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.192
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.149
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
				</span></i>
