				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόμφων τ.</span> for boring
			holes for dowels, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.205.8
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
